"subs": [
{
"t": 0.15,
"dur": 2.473,
"text": "Four seconds. The blanket, flat at the neck."
},
{
"t": 3.423,
"dur": 6.172,
"text": "Only Mrs. Hanh next door stayed quiet. She came over, sat down, and looked at me for a long time."
},
{
"t": 9.845,
"dur": 1.476,
"text": "Granny Tu. Be careful."
},
{
"t": 11.571,
"dur": 6.443,
"text": "She didn't mean my son should be careful. She meant me. Turns out, someone can know you're a ghost and still worry about you."
},
{
"t": 18.514,
"dur": 3.337,
"text": "That night, he put a camera on top of the cabinet. The title:"
},
{
"t": 23.951,
"dur": 4.409,
"text": "At two fifteen, he nodded off. Nine thousand people stayed awake for him."
},
{
"t": 28.609,
"dur": 1.28,
"text": "And my head got lighter."
},
{
"t": 30.689,
"dur": 2.694,
"text": "His phone buzzed. He woke up. Looked at the bed."
},
{
"t": 33.783,
"dur": 2.466,
"text": "What did he do next? I'll tell you next time."
}
],
